F src/cli/present.ts 69269ecebef9 2026-10-10 80552949+warrendeanlangeveldt/human What a person sees about Context Graph, for the mod and the terminal: fileContext (card, rules, chain, newest decisions, and whether an agent understood the file, reusing checkEdit), agentCoverage (per agent read, searched, edited with understanding, cards owed), proposals with evidence (decisions that served and overrode each, counted and dated in servedOn and overriddenOn for the queue's sparklines), and the person's commit path (commitRefusal before any change: in-repo graph, unprotected branch, ratifier; commitGraph commits only graph files with the person's trailer). Never names another tool: protected branches come from tool adapters.
