F src/cli/guide.ts 117a01f34f0e 2026-10-10 80552949+warrendeanlangeveldt/human Guidance for people: ctx cards (fresh, stale and missing cards, for all files, those this branch changed (--changed), or one module's (--module <L:id>: files whose walked chain names it, for the card writer's Cards for this module)) and ctx next (the one step to take, checked in priority order: no graph, broken graph or doctor failure, what the last session owes, the instruction block, changed files without cards, proposals and hygiene findings waiting for a person). Relies on cards.ts, the walker, doctor, hygiene, the recorder and git. The next skill runs its --json output and dispatches to the named skill, so step names must match skill names (init, status, cards, curate, done). Loaded lazily through commands.ts, so hooks never pay for it.
