F adapters/claude-code/hooks/mod/register.mjs 4058ecdd4cd6 2026-10-10 80552949+warrendeanlangeveldt/human The Context Graph mod's hooks (Claude Code 2.1.287+): registers /graph and /graph-settings, and the card writer's agent (re-registered when its model setting changes). /graph toggles the Context pane; /graph <path> opens it on that file, pinned (code-kit's combined view opens files this way). Follows the file an agent last read or edited from tool.call when not pinned, and there keeps read-assist (a read-before-edit refusal by its call's id, a subagent told what to read) and edits that went through (their card-owed tag, and when each file was last edited). Reads the ctx CLI's JSON (info, proposals, cards and cards --changed, agents, file, neighbours, settings), refreshing reading lists' progress, within 2 s of a tool call or a .ctx file change. The card writer (spec 04): when the lead's turn ends, the card writer is on, no batch is running and the plan is below the pause point (code-kit's when it sets one; session.measure keeps the plan's use), the lead is asked to start it on the next batch of jobs (asked, owed, changed); a batch is done file by file as cards turn current, and the writer's own last turn frees it; Write card and Cards for this module queue files for it while it's on (CARDW-4). Keeps the pane's tab, selection and back stack; Escape goes back before it closes. Draws the Context pane, the Drop dialog, the Settings view, the band's health line, tool rows' tags and a refused edit's reading list; runs the person's acts only from its own buttons. Never enforces; never imports src.
