F adapters/claude-code/hooks/mod/register.mjs aef28b4a2331 2026-10-10 80552949+warrendeanlangeveldt/human The Context Graph mod's hooks (Claude Code 2.1.287+): registers /graph and /graph-settings, and the card writer's and curator's agents (re-registered when their model settings change). /graph toggles the Context pane; /graph <path> opens it on that file, pinned. Follows the file an agent last read or edited from tool.call when not pinned, and keeps read-assist (a read-before-edit refusal by its call's id, a subagent told what to read) and edits that went through (their card-owed tag, and when each file was last edited). Reads the ctx CLI's JSON (info with its counts, proposals, hygiene's flagged rules, cards and cards --changed, agents, file, neighbours, settings), refreshing reading lists' progress, within 2 s of a tool call or a .ctx file change. When the lead's turn ends, one background agent may start, the plan below the pause point (code-kit's when it sets one; session.measure keeps the plan's use): the card writer's next batch first (spec 04), else the curator after 10 new decisions or the person's Curate now (spec 05); each agent's own last turn frees it, and the curator counts from its last run. Keeps the pane's tab, selection and back stack; Escape goes back before it closes. Draws the Context pane, the Drop dialog, the Settings view, the band's health line (flagged rules count toward it), tool rows' tags and a refused edit's reading list; runs the person's acts only from its own buttons. Never enforces; never imports src.
